  "content": {
    "component": "news_article",
    "_uid": "1292-root",
    "title": "Pursuant of a Masters of Science in Nursing",
    "subtitle": null,
    "summary": "Uganda faculty, Abubaker Mohammed decides to pursue a Masters of Science in Nursing.",
    "media": [],
    "body": {
      "type": "doc",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Abubaker Mohammed, a nursing faculty member from Uganda, takes leave to pursue a Master's of Science in Nursing with a focus in teaching at the University of Alberta, Canada. He has decided that now is the right time to make this move, to ensure he continues to meet teaching qualifications required by the regulatory body in Uganda. "
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "He hopes to complete the programme in 2-3 years, depending on completion of his thesis. Afterwards, Mr Mohammed plans to return as faculty and start a PhD programme as soon as possible. SONAM wishes Mr Mohammed the best of luck with his studies."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
